  "description": "C# API client for interacting with the Gotenberg v7, v8 & v9 micro-service's API, a docker-powered stateless API for converting & merging HTML, Markdown and Office documents to PDF, taking screenshots, and performing standalone PDF operations (flatten, rotate, split, encrypt, bookmarks, embedded files). The client registers as a typed HttpClient, so retries and timeouts can be added with Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience.",
